.TH tkldif n 0.28.0 tkutils "Tcl/Tk Utility Library"
.SH NAME
tkutils::tkldif \- LDIF entry viewer
.SH SYNOPSIS
package require tkutils::tkldif
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows LDIF entries in a tree (dn nodes with attribute children), via
tclutils::tuldif. See docs/tkldif.md.
.SH KEYWORDS
Tk, widget, ldif, ldap
